            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai mam Kristo alomarit aibois nakalaunan nakiswamao kakanin, nakeputosi kaŋin kanakabeit, konye toma akuj alopet, atakanu kwana kakonyen nuka Edeke kanuwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
